1902,1903,1904,1905,1906,1907,1908,1909,1910,1911,1912,1913,1914,1915,1916,1917,1918,1919,1920,1921,1922,1923,1924,1925,1926,1927,1928,1929,1930,1931,1932,2087,2088,2089,2090,2091,2092,2093,2094,2095,2096,2097,2098,2099,2100,2101,2102,2103,2104,2105,2106,2107,2108,2109,2110,2111,2112,2113,2114,2115,2116,2117,2118,2119,2120,2121,2122,2123,2124,2125,2126,2127,2128,2129,2130,2131,2132,2133]},"chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-058-luxun","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-058","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-058-luxun"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-058-luxun:line025","text":"諸將並曰：「攻備當在初，今乃令人五六百里，相銜持經七八月，其諸要害皆以固守，擊之必無利矣。」遜曰：「備是猾虜，更嘗事多，其軍始集，思慮精專，未可干也。今住己久，不得我便，兵疲意沮，計不復生，掎角此寇，正在今日。」乃先攻一營，不利。諸將皆曰：「空殺兵耳。」遜曰：「吾已曉破之之術。」乃敕各持一把茅，以火攻拔之。一爾勢成，通率諸軍同時俱攻，斬張南、馮習及胡王沙靡柯等首，破其四十餘營。備將杜路、劉寧等窮逼請降。備升馬鞍山，陳兵自繞。遜督促諸軍四面蹙之，土崩瓦解，死者萬數。備因夜遁，驛人自擔燒鐃鎧斷後，僅得入白帝城。其舟船器械，水步軍資，一時略盡，屍骸漂流，塞江而下。備大慚恚，曰：「吾乃為遜所折辱，豈非天邪!」","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-058-luxun:line025:m0007","start":7,"end":8,"surface":"備","kind":"person","person_id":"5f2_396_25c","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-058-luxun:line025:m0046","start":46,"end":47,"surface":"遜","kind":"person","person_id":"lii_454_vuv","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-058-luxun:line025:m0050","start":50,"end":51,"surface":"備","kind":"person","person_id":"5f2_396_25c","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-058-luxun:line025:m0127","start":127,"end":128,"surface":"遜","kind":"person","person_id":"lii_454_vuv","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-058-luxun:line025:m0169","start":169,"end":171,"surface":"張南","kind":"person","person_id":"rfm_te3_2ek","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-058-luxun:line025:m0172","start":172,"end":174,"surface":"馮習","kind":"person","person_id":"bv3_5tk_8rq",